moria-fw (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * UPX byte-exact ELF unpacking; boot-level artifacts and verified-boot metadata.
  * New filesystems: LittleFS and SPIFFS (identify + extract), plus identify for
    GPT/MBR partition maps, LUKS1/2, and a legacy block-FS batch
    (NILFS2/Minix/ReiserFS/UFS/APFS/LogFS).
  * ESP32 partition table + NVS; UBIFS orphaned-inode recovery; standalone LZMA.
  * Windows CE XIP ROM, MS-CAB, and CFBF/MSI compound files; Artosyn OTRA images.
  * Per-section entropy column (-E) and a recursive extraction tree in -e output.

 -- Matt Brown <matt@brownfinesecurity.com>  Mon, 05 Oct 2026 13:01:08 -0400

